      "text": "Render of Box 10, 'Telehealth for PrEP during COVID-19 in Brazil', with its text on the ImPrEP and PrEP1519 projects and Fig. 3, a photograph of a PrEP1519 participant at home with an HIV prevention kit including an HIVST (photo credit: Project1519).",
